DewfordTown_House2_Text_H0::
    .string "Look at this scarf. Go on, look.\p"
    .string "Cost me a week at the SLATEPORT\n"
    .string "market and I've worn it exactly\l"
    .string "once, because it rains here.\p"
    .string "No, you can't have it.$"

DewfordTown_House2_Text_H1::
    .string "You crossed the water to get to\n"
    .string "DEWFORD? On purpose?\p"
    .string "It'll be BRAWLY. It's always\n"
    .string "BRAWLY.\p"
    .string "Half this island would follow him\n"
    .string "into the sea, and some have.$"
